{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e64fd30d93bb7b84b6ae40284e90cf59a1aa93fa6e0ca113b587a4e219021964", "ja": "（翼のPV撮影が終わった。元気いっぱいで楽しそうな\n翼の姿に、現場の雰囲気も明るかったな）", "zh": "（翼的PV拍摄结束了。活力十足、看起来很开心的翼，也让现场的气氛变得明亮起来了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d0239e92810e54b28ac181090e96423927ead7916c50025a928c550af008eb96", "ja": "ん～、楽しかった～！　{$P$}さん、\nどうでしたか？　今日のわたし♪", "zh": "嗯～好开心～！{$P$}先生，觉得怎么样？今天的我♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c7bffffcd8690ccd73b7b058a46a5025eb6e8580fddfe2f089392effb69d3bfa", "ja": "ああ、すごくよかったよ。\n見た人が元気になる……そんなPVになりそうだ。", "zh": "啊，非常棒。\n感觉会成为一部让看过的人打起精神来的……这样的PV。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "54b89952db58b0584a16fcb24115bc9b018dba4c30132646af8e0b197dff2a4e", "ja": "えへへっ。わたし、頑張ったんです！\nだから……いっぱい褒めてくれますか～？", "zh": "嘿嘿，我可是很努力了！\n所以……可以多夸夸我吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1004_p", "source_sha256": "270e163718c1510e72112aa9033d7154a13e0d0138835d1c3f6f0db330e6acfe", "ja": "もちろん。撮影中も、積極的に意見を言ってくれたし、\n演出の提案もしてくれたろ？", "zh": "当然。拍摄过程中你也积极地提出了意见，\n还给演出提了建议，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2ba359f64364095cfc9ae4523b999da5d4e90fa97707c4fda323f9b2ef39a64b", "ja": "おかげで魅力的な翼が録れたよ。\nスタッフさん達も楽しそうだったし。ありがとな、翼。", "zh": "多亏了你，才录下了充满魅力的翼。工作人员们看起来也很开心。谢谢你，翼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5ce898efdd944e96617de941cc271e0a28af0fb05253d1cc28fd875ec14820da", "ja": "……あれ？　なんか思った以上にほめられちゃった。\n{$P$}さん、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "……咦？好像被夸得比想象中还多。\n{$P$}先生，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2ffd39c945f1eb705bd9781aac66bd8d67ce059a20617125818bd95d9acdd30e", "ja": "別に、ただ思ったことを言っただけだよ。", "zh": "没什么，只是把想说的话说出来而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4e020702d4a40c7c5cbeb617b9102c03e9e8179100319981fe6b7dfccfda84b0", "ja": "わたしだって、そうですよー。\n楽しいから、もっとやっちゃえ～ってカンジ♪", "zh": "我也是这样哦～。\n感觉好开心，所以就觉得多来点嘛～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4a47ed5b089d8555bca013c19939bc8dcbdafd6e25b8159ef0677e47dbe2e0d7", "ja": "お仕事は楽しかったし、{$P$}さんに\nいっぱい褒めてもらえたし……。", "zh": "工作很开心，而且还得到了{$P$}先生好多夸奖……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f7c7a22466e86760e63de9158c36853bfee48ebd19be13d23422696a9f9abb3a", "ja": "ひょっとして、今日は超ラッキーデーかも？", "zh": "说不定今天是超级幸运日？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1011_p", "source_sha256": "54c1e024ed9b3730a450bfe46ed190256d851f80c5b44c520de932c98ee21894", "ja": "ははっ。そうかもしれないな！", "zh": "哈哈，说不定真是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6b222e5308ae2caa03d059bbdde04e61604d655eb7d8435234d6d8286760d1dc", "ja": "わあ～！　こんな日がずっと続いたら、\nわたし、もっともっと頑張れちゃうかも！", "zh": "哇～！要是这样的日子能一直持续下去，\n我搞不好会更加更加努力呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1013_p", "source_sha256": "45fca87fa62ce82baa56ceeaad0916a98bfa3f44c131cdb36fb4c21ff2cc4d38", "ja": "おお～。\n毎日、翼が頑張ってくれるなら、俺も嬉しいな。", "zh": "哦哦～。\n如果翼每天都这么努力，我也会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d763265ecf804c0ccb8d236ae8e1c679f4a0505025b43276e778c8794bfd6b8f", "ja": "でもでも、つまんないお仕事はイヤですよ。\nわたし、楽しくて、ハッピーなお仕事がいいでーす♪", "zh": "不过不过，我可不要无聊的工作哦。\n我想要有趣又开心的工作♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "dc2a204b01a8a5bdb416fe5443177f2db5ac085f54f799382aa66fc92c9d03fb", "ja": "そしたら、みんなが喜んでくれますよね？\nみんなが喜んでくれたら、わたしももっと楽しいもん！", "zh": "这样的话，大家都会很开心吧？\n大家开心的话，我也会更快乐嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ecfbda4889582d302eb7940be71a319d9ae7f8ee462ce7ebf611a158ae2da2a9", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。これからも、\n翼がハッピーな気分で仕事ができるように善処するよ。", "zh": "啊，是啊。今后也会尽力让翼能开开心心地工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "68563313ea8ba3b40f14c55059652d31e7ded7ceb8bc324d24c74e2eced221cf", "ja": "今の言葉、約束ですよ♪\nそれじゃ、わたし着替えてきまーす。", "zh": "你刚才说的话，可要算数哦♪\n那么，我去换衣服啦——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ad4f669f3c18db68dccf007e1b7b0f65629f450f8178cdfafa1e68dfbe408a58", "ja": "あ、そうだ……！\nあのね、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "啊，对了……！\n那个，{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7c59608752f267d6180b140d18e7d63d6eab88ec8f53b1bf3132cb2afda45b46", "ja": "うん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e3f445ab4172b7b4bf3a0984db24c00e72fab21c9b781d1c115eccc35ffdbbcf", "ja": "わたしが一番喜んでほしいのは、\n{$P$}さんだけだから。", "zh": "我最希望感到高兴的人，\n就只有{$P$}先生而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "da07c66c656f75c5370faaa1835146a32081fc1669a675260dcfbaa331ee0b69", "ja": "勘違いしないでくださいね。\n……えへへ、それだけでーす☆", "zh": "可别误会哦。\n……嘿嘿，就这些啦～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0604_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4a68df66bd088686492f940bf7dd319f6dd8dcf3dfa13e8c170b4a5f3f4d013b", "ja": "（翼はいつだって、楽しいことに全力で挑んでいる。\nアイドルへの興味が続くように、俺も頑張らないとな）", "zh": "（翼无论何时都会全力以赴地挑战有趣的事情。为了让她继续对偶像感兴趣，我也得努力才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
